{"task_id": "Mbpp/91", "solution": "def find_substring(values: list[str], query: str, case_sensitive: bool = True) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if a string is present as a substring in a given list of string values.\"\"\"\n    if not query:\n        return False\n\n    for item in values:\n        if case_sensitive:\n            if query in item:\n                return True\n        else:\n            if query.lower() in item.lower():\n                return True\n    return False"}
