{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "import collections\ndef validate(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in an integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    The sign of the input integer is ignored for digit extraction.\n    \"\"\"\n    n_abs = abs(n)\n    s_n = str(n_abs)\n    digit_counts = collections.Counter(int(d) for d in s_n)\n\n    for digit, freq in digit_counts.items():\n        if freq > digit:\n            return False\n    return True"}
