{"task_id": "Mbpp/555", "solution": "def difference(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the difference between the sum of cubes of the first n natural numbers\n    and the sum of the first n natural numbers using closed-form formulas.\n    \"\"\"\n    # Sum of first n natural numbers: n * (n + 1) // 2\n    sum_n_naturals = n * (n + 1) // 2\n\n    # Sum of cubes of first n natural numbers: (n * (n + 1) // 2)^2\n    sum_n_cubes = sum_n_naturals * sum_n_naturals\n\n    return sum_n_cubes - sum_n_naturals"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/556", "solution": "def find_Odd_Pair(arr, n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of pairs in an array whose XOR value is odd.\n    A pair's XOR is odd if one number is even and the other is odd.\n    \"\"\"\n    count_even = 0\n    count_odd = 0\n    for x in arr:\n        if x % 2 == 0:\n            count_even += 1\n        else:\n            count_odd += 1\n    return count_even * count_odd"}
