{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "def prime_num(n: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if the given integer is a prime number using trial division with 6k+-1 optimization.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n <= 3:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0 or n % 3 == 0:\n        return False\n    \n    i = 5\n    while i * i <= n:\n        if n % i == 0 or n % (i + 2) == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 6\n    return True"}
