{"task_id": "Mbpp/731", "solution": "import math\ndef lateralsurface_cone(r, h):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the lateral surface area of a cone given radius r and height h.\n    The formula is pi * r * sqrt(r^2 + h^2).\n    \"\"\"\n    slant_height = math.hypot(r, h)\n    area = math.pi * r * slant_height\n    return area"}
