{"task_id": "Mbpp/740", "solution": "def tuple_to_dict(tuple_obj: tuple) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Converts a tuple of adjacent elements into a key-value dictionary.\n    Duplicate keys are handled by the last occurrence in the tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    result_dict = {}\n    for i in range(0, len(tuple_obj), 2):\n        key = tuple_obj[i]\n        value = tuple_obj[i+1]\n        result_dict[key] = value\n    return result_dict"}
