{"task_id": "Mbpp/793", "solution": "from typing import Sequence, Optional, TypeVar\nT = TypeVar(\"T\")\ndef last(array: Sequence[T], value: T) -> Optional[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the last position of an element in a sorted array using binary search.\n    Returns the index if found, otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    index = None\n    low, high = 0, len(array) - 1\n\n    while low <= high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if array[mid] <= value:\n            if array[mid] == value:\n                index = mid\n            low = mid + 1\n        else:\n            high = mid - 1\n            \n    return index"}
