{"task_id": "Mbpp/809", "solution": "def check_smaller(first: tuple, second: tuple) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if each element of the second tuple is strictly smaller than its\n    corresponding element in the first tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    if len(first) != len(second):\n        return False\n\n    for f_val, s_val in zip(first, second):\n        if not (s_val < f_val):\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
